+## Subtopics
+
+### First-order Spherical Harmonics Distillation
+Distills SH coefficients into a simpler representation for faster rendering. Choose when memory bandwidth is the bottleneck. [Link](9467-first-order-spherical-harmonics-distillation.md)
+
+### Explicit Camera Jacobian Derivation
+Provides analytical gradients for camera parameters. Choose when joint optimization of geometry and appearance is required. [Link](10077-explicit-camera-jacobian-derivation.md)
+
+### Efficient Multi-View Training for 3D Gaussian Splatting
+Optimizes the training pipeline for multiple views. Choose when training time is critical. [Link](13982-efficient-multi-view-training-for-3d-gaussian-splatting.md)
+
+### Spherical Harmonics Vector Quantization
+Reduces SH coefficient storage via quantization. Choose when memory footprint must be minimized. [Link](14181-spherical-harmonics-vector-quantization.md)
+
+### Adaptive SH Regularization
+The core regularization strategy used in this method. Choose when view support is uneven. [Link](16786-adaptive-sh-regularization.md)
+
+### Geometry-Guided Appearance Modeling
+Uses geometry to constrain appearance. Choose when geometric fidelity is paramount. [Link](20876-geometry-guided-appearance-modeling.md)
