+The method originates from "CF-Splat: Closed-Form Triangle Splatting with Mesh Priors" [S1, unofficial]. It addresses the limitations of iterative SH optimization in 3D Gaussian Splatting by providing a closed-form solution for mesh-based scene representation. The approach leverages the structure of the problem to enable efficient global optimization.
 
